@startuml CU-20
actor "Cliente" as Cli
boundary "«UI» Angular (carrito de compras)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /cart" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» CartService / Cart / Sale / Payment" as Model

Cli -> UI : Abre su carrito de compras
UI -> Ctrl : GET /cart
Ctrl -> Model : get_active_cart(db, user_id)
Model --> Ctrl : CartRead (items, total)
Ctrl --> UI : CartRead
UI --> Cli : Ítems del carrito

Cli -> UI : Cambia la cantidad de una prenda
UI -> Ctrl : PATCH /cart/items/{variant_id} {quantity}
Ctrl -> Model : update_item(db, cart, variant_id, quantity)
Model --> Ctrl : CartRead
Ctrl --> UI : CartRead
UI --> Cli : Total recalculado

Cli -> UI : Quita una prenda del carrito
UI -> Ctrl : DELETE /cart/items/{variant_id}
Ctrl -> Model : remove_item(db, cart, variant_id)
Model --> Ctrl : CartRead

Cli -> UI : Decide comprar (carrito activo)
UI -> Ctrl : POST /cart/purchase {método de pago}
Ctrl -> Model : create_sale + pago iniciado + carrito inactivo
Model --> Ctrl : PurchaseResponse {sale, payment}
Ctrl --> UI : PurchaseResponse (redirige a pago / CU-21)

@enduml